sequenceDiagram
  actor RTO
  participant UI as React app
  participant IPFS as IPFS (Pinata)
  participant MM as MetaMask
  participant C as VehicleRegistry
  participant N as VehicleNFT
  RTO->>UI: Fill vehicle details + choose RC scan
  UI->>IPFS: upload file
  IPFS-->>UI: CID
  RTO->>UI: Register vehicle
  UI->>MM: registerVehicle(spec with CID)
  MM->>C: signed transaction
  C->>C: check RTO_ROLE, VIN length 17, VIN and plate unique
  C->>N: mint(owner, tokenIdOf(vin))
  C-->>UI: emit VehicleRegistered(vin, owner, rto)
  UI-->>RTO: "confirmed in block N"
